flowchart TD
  A[Request with credential] --> B[Extract token]
  B --> C[Verify signature and algorithm]
  C --> D[Validate issuer, audience and time]
  D --> E{Identity verified?}
  E -->|No| X401[401 Unauthorized]
  E -->|Yes| F[Build minimal trusted principal]
  F --> G[Load route permission policy]
  G --> H{Permission granted?}
  H -->|No| X403[403 Forbidden]
  H -->|Yes| I[Continue to quota and routing]
